#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Import {#import}"
msgstr "Importación {#import}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For backward compatibility, you must explicity import the V2 primitives. "
"Specifying `import <primitive>V2 as <primitive>` is not required, but makes "
"it easier to transition code to V2.\n"
msgstr ""
"Por compatibilidad con versiones anteriores, debes importar explícitamente "
"las primitivas V2. Especificar `import <primitive>V2 as <primitive>` no es "
"obligatorio, pero facilita la transición del código a V2.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"warning\">\n"
"After the V1 primitives are no longer supported, `import <primitive>` will import the V2 version of the specified primitive.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"warning\">\n"
"Cuando las primitivas V1 dejen de tener soporte, `import <primitive>` importará la versión V2 de la primitiva indicada.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

